# Scanno project

- Monorepo: `backend/` (Django+DRF), `web/` (Next.js), `mobile/` (Expo), `docs/`, `docker-compose.yml`.
- Working name Scanno; brand candidate Rebuyly — avoid mass rename unless asked.
- Local: `docker compose up --build` → web :3000, API :8000, MinIO :9000.
- Product rules: one review/user/product; barcode is canonical key; catalog photos locked; user products editable only by creator. Details in `docs/PRODUCT_IDENTITY.md`.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, `.env.local`). Prefer `docs/ONBOARDING.md` + `AGENTS.md` for setup.
- Keep diffs focused; follow existing patterns in each app.
- Web component styling: keep component styles in colocated `ComponentName.module.css` files and import them as CSS Modules. Do not put Tailwind utility strings, inline `style={{ ... }}`, or component-specific CSS in JSX unless there is a narrow runtime-only reason such as canvas drawing logic.
